- Candidate must have a verifiable URL citation.
- Candidate published_date must be inside query_month.
- Candidate region_bucket must directly match the query bucket.
- Candidate must have model_utility HIGH and score_signal_strength STRONG.
- Candidate confidence must be at least 0.80.
- Candidate impact_direction_hint must not be unknown.
- Candidate topic and reason_codes must use supported values.
- Reject advertising-like presale promotion, simple price rankings, celebrity or personal purchases, overseas real estate, stock market commentary, generic macro comments without apartment-market linkage, unclear dates, unclear regional effect, candidates unverifiable by citation, and candidates that only make sense with article body text.
- Pass examples: 강남구 토지거래허가구역 지정, 대출규제 강화, GTX 정차 or 개통 확정, 대규모 입주 물량 발표.
- Reject examples: 강남 아파트 인기 여전, 분양 상담 광고, 전망만 있는 칼럼, 지역명만 언급된 전국 기사.
